    "background_story": "Cora was a determined and resourceful young woman who grew up on a small farm during a severe drought. With the cattle struggling to produce milk, Cora's family was on the brink of losing their livelihood. Undeterred, Cora took it upon herself to find alternative sources of income. She began experimenting with plant-based recipes, using the farm's limited resources to create delicious and innovative milkless treats. Her creations quickly gained popularity at the local farmer's market, and soon Cora's farm was thriving once again. As the drought eventually subsided, Cora's milkless products remained a staple, and she became known as a pioneer in the field of sustainable and dairy-free cuisine. Her determination and creativity had turned a crisis into an opportunity, ensuring the farm's future for generations to come.",
